resources.string:
Troubleshoot the following issues, and try again: 
1. Please make sure the mobile network signal is good; 
2. Please make sure that the upper part of the phone is placed on the console reader sensor area in the pairing process; 
If you still have any questions, please contact the customer service centre of a local BYD dealer

Troubleshoot the following issues and try again:
 1. Please make sure the mobile network signal is good;
 2. Please make sure that the upper part of the phone is placed in the sensing area of the card reader in the pairing process;
 If you still have any questions, please contact a local %s dealer or the customer service

Three immobiliser modes:
a. Enable immobiliser: Unlock the vehicle before manually pressing the charger lock button to remove the charger;
b. Disable immobiliser: Directly press the charger lock button to pull out the charger;
c. Intelligent immobiliser: In case of full charge, directly press the charger lock button to pull out the charger; otherwise, unlock the vehicle before manually pressing the charger lock button to pull out the charger

Function Introduction: 
1. When SAVE Mode is turned on and battery drops below the target by a certain amount in driving, the system will actively reserve the power based on the target energy you set to make the actual power close to the target. Fuel consumption and noise may increase in this process; 

2. When SAVE Mode is turned off, the vehicle will intelligently manage the power of the whole vehicle in driving according to the driving mode, environment, driver's behaviour on the basis of economical mode. 

Tips: 
1. It is recommended to turn off SAVE Mode in short trip to improve the energy economy; 

2. For a long trip or high demand on power after reaching the destination, such as camping, rescue operation, and so on, it is recommended to turn on SAVE Mode and set a higher target to improve the user's experience.
